Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Remove=20fake=20phone=20mockup=20frame=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20app=20now=20fills=20the=20real=20device=20screen?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Delete PhoneFrame.jsx (had hardcoded 390x844 size, fake status bar with
  9:41/signal/wifi/battery, rounded corners, shadow — was fine for desktop
  preview but was shipping to real phones, causing a 'phone inside phone' look)
- New AppShell.jsx: full width/100dvh, no fixed size, no mockup chrome,
  uses env(safe-area-inset-top/bottom) for real notch/Dynamic Island/home
  indicator/gesture-bar spacing on both iOS and Android
- index.html: viewport meta now includes viewport-fit=cover (required for
  safe-area-inset-* to resolve on iOS)
- index.css: html/body/#root sized to fill the viewport; app background
  color moved from the old outer preview bg to the real page background
- BottomNav: bottom padding now uses env(safe-area-inset-bottom) instead
  of a hardcoded 14px guess
